# Documentation

- Prefer updating existing canonical docs over new parallel files.
- Keep `progress.md` in sync when completing a phase.
- Russian prose OK; technical identifiers in English.
- Link related ADRs and implementation-plan phases.
- Do not invent “done” status for work that was not implemented.
